I walk to the bus stop.
There are a few people at the stop.
The bus to Infopark arrives.
I get on that bus.
The conductor comes near me.
"Where to?" he asks.
"To Infopark."
"One ticket," I reply.
"Twenty rupees," he says.
I give twenty rupees to him.
He gives me the ticket.
I get a seat near the window.
I sit in that seat.
The bus goes through the busy city.
I look outside through the window.
I like the morning sights in Kochi.
